    {
      "id": "fundFlowDetail",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 860,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "DETAILED FUND FLOW:\n\n1. PROJECT FUNDING: Originator deposits reward tokens (USDC/USDT) into Rewards contract escrow\n   → fundProject(projectId, amount, quantity) → Rewards.allocateRewards()\n\n2. STAKE LOCKING: Contributors and Validators deposit SAPIEN tokens into SapienVault\n   → Contributors: lockStake() when claiming work slots\n   → Validators: setValidatorCapacity() to establish validation capacity pool\n\n3. VALIDATION COMMITMENT: Validators commit scores (in-flight stake tracked against capacity)\n   → commitValidation() increments in-flight stake\n   → revealValidation() releases in-flight stake back to capacity\n\n4. FINALIZATION & REWARDS:\n   → Accepted Work: Rewards.distributeReward(contributor, 90% of task reward)\n   → Honest Validators: Rewards.distributeValidatorReward(validator, stake-weighted share of 10%)\n   → Outlier Validators: Vault.slash() removes portion of stake (redistributed to honest stakers)\n\n5. CLAIMING: Contributors and Validators claim earned rewards\n   → claimRewards() / claimValidatorRewards() → ERC20 transfer to user wallet",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 43,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1321993506,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769016101004,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "frameId": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DETAILED FUND FLOW:\n\n1. PROJECT FUNDING: Originator deposits reward tokens (USDC/USDT) into Rewards contract escrow\n   → fundProject(projectId, amount, quantity) → Rewards.allocateRewards()\n\n2. STAKE LOCKING: Contributors and Validators deposit SAPIEN tokens into SapienVault\n   → Contributors: lockStake() when claiming work slots\n   → Validators: setValidatorCapacity() to establish validation capacity pool\n\n3. VALIDATION COMMITMENT: Validators commit scores (in-flight stake tracked against capacity)\n   → commitValidation() increments in-flight stake\n   → revealValidation() releases in-flight stake back to capacity\n\n4. FINALIZATION & REWARDS:\n   → Accepted Work: Rewards.distributeReward(contributor, 90% of task reward)\n   → Honest Validators: Rewards.distributeValidatorReward(validator, stake-weighted share of 10%)\n   → Outlier Validators: Vault.slash() removes portion of stake (redistributed to honest stakers)\n\n5. CLAIMING: Contributors and Validators claim earned rewards\n   → claimRewards() / claimValidatorRewards() → ERC20 transfer to user wallet",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ag"
    },
    {
      "id": "slashNote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "⚡ SLASHING MECHANISM: When validators are outliers (deviate >2σ from consensus),\ntheir stake is slashed via Vault.slash(). Slashed tokens remain in vault, increasing\nshare price for honest stakers (automatic redistribution).",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
      "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2",
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 44,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1471927806,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769016101004,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "frameId": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚡ SLASHING MECHANISM: When validators are outliers (deviate >2σ from consensus),\ntheir stake is slashed via Vault.slash(). Slashed tokens remain in vault, increasing\nshare price for honest stakers (automatic redistribution).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ah"
    },
    {
      "id": "economicsSection",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 400,
