    {
      "id": "exampleText",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 440,
      "text": "📊 CONCRETE EXAMPLE: Data Labeling Project\n\nPROJECT SETUP:\n• Originator funds: 10,000 USDC for 100 work units\n• Per-unit reward: 100 USDC (10,000 ÷ 100)\n• Validator reward split: 10% (default)\n\nSTAKING REQUIREMENTS:\n• Originator: 1,000 SAPIEN tokens (staked in Vault)\n• Contributor: 100 SAPIEN tokens per work slot (locked)\n• Validator: 100 SAPIEN tokens minimum (capacity pool)\n\nEXAMPLE FLOW FOR 1 ACCEPTED CONTRIBUTION:\n\n1️⃣ FUNDING (Originator → Rewards Contract):\n   • Originator deposits: 10,000 USDC\n   • Rewards.allocateRewards() → Escrow: 10,000 USDC\n\n2️⃣ CONTRIBUTOR STAKING (Contributor → Vault):\n   • Contributor locks: 100 SAPIEN tokens\n   • Vault.lockStake() → Locked stake: 100 SAPIEN\n\n3️⃣ VALIDATOR STAKING (3 Validators → Vault):\n   • Validator A: 500 SAPIEN (capacity)\n   • Validator B: 300 SAPIEN (capacity)\n   • Validator C: 200 SAPIEN (capacity)\n   • Total validator capacity: 1,000 SAPIEN\n\n4️⃣ VALIDATION & CONSENSUS:\n   • Validator A scores: 85/100 (weighted avg: 85%)\n   • Validator B scores: 82/100 (weighted avg: 82%)\n   • Validator C scores: 90/100 (weighted avg: 90%)\n   • Consensus score: 85.2/100 → ACCEPTED (≥50%)\n\n5️⃣ REWARD DISTRIBUTION:\n   • Task reward pool: 100 USDC\n   • Contributor reward (90%): 90 USDC → Contributor wallet\n   • Validator pool (10%): 10 USDC\n     - Validator A (50% stake): 5.00 USDC\n     - Validator B (30% stake): 3.00 USDC\n     - Validator C (20% stake): 2.00 USDC\n\n6️⃣ SLASHING SCENARIO (if Validator C was outlier):\n   • Validator C deviates >2σ → Slashed: 20 SAPIEN (10%)\n   • Slashed tokens stay in vault → Share price increases\n   • Validator C gets NO reward\n   • Validator pool redistributed:\n     - Validator A (62.5%): 6.25 USDC\n     - Validator B (37.5%): 3.75 USDC\n\n7️⃣ CLAIMING:\n   • Contributor: claimRewards() → Receives 90 USDC\n   • Validators: claimValidatorRewards() → Receive their share\n\n💰 TOTAL ECONOMICS:\n• Originator pays: 10,000 USDC\n• Contributors earn: 9,000 USDC (90% × 100 units)\n• Validators earn: 1,000 USDC (10% × 100 units)\n• Slashed tokens: Redistributed to honest stakers (increases vault share price)",
      "fontSize": 10.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 47,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1510122658,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769016101004,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "frameId": null,
      "containerId": "exampleBox",
      "originalText": "📊 CONCRETE EXAMPLE: Data Labeling Project\n\nPROJECT SETUP:\n• Originator funds: 10,000 USDC for 100 work units\n• Per-unit reward: 100 USDC (10,000 ÷ 100)\n• Validator reward split: 10% (default)\n\nSTAKING REQUIREMENTS:\n• Originator: 1,000 SAPIEN tokens (staked in Vault)\n• Contributor: 100 SAPIEN tokens per work slot (locked)\n• Validator: 100 SAPIEN tokens minimum (capacity pool)\n\nEXAMPLE FLOW FOR 1 ACCEPTED CONTRIBUTION:\n\n1️⃣ FUNDING (Originator → Rewards Contract):\n   • Originator deposits: 10,000 USDC\n   • Rewards.allocateRewards() → Escrow: 10,000 USDC\n\n2️⃣ CONTRIBUTOR STAKING (Contributor → Vault):\n   • Contributor locks: 100 SAPIEN tokens\n   • Vault.lockStake() → Locked stake: 100 SAPIEN\n\n3️⃣ VALIDATOR STAKING (3 Validators → Vault):\n   • Validator A: 500 SAPIEN (capacity)\n   • Validator B: 300 SAPIEN (capacity)\n   • Validator C: 200 SAPIEN (capacity)\n   • Total validator capacity: 1,000 SAPIEN\n\n4️⃣ VALIDATION & CONSENSUS:\n   • Validator A scores: 85/100 (weighted avg: 85%)\n   • Validator B scores: 82/100 (weighted avg: 82%)\n   • Validator C scores: 90/100 (weighted avg: 90%)\n   • Consensus score: 85.2/100 → ACCEPTED (≥50%)\n\n5️⃣ REWARD DISTRIBUTION:\n   • Task reward pool: 100 USDC\n   • Contributor reward (90%): 90 USDC → Contributor wallet\n   • Validator pool (10%): 10 USDC\n     - Validator A (50% stake): 5.00 USDC\n     - Validator B (30% stake): 3.00 USDC\n     - Validator C (20% stake): 2.00 USDC\n\n6️⃣ SLASHING SCENARIO (if Validator C was outlier):\n   • Validator C deviates >2σ → Slashed: 20 SAPIEN (10%)\n   • Slashed tokens stay in vault → Share price increases\n   • Validator C gets NO reward\n   • Validator pool redistributed:\n     - Validator A (62.5%): 6.25 USDC\n     - Validator B (37.5%): 3.75 USDC\n\n7️⃣ CLAIMING:\n   • Contributor: claimRewards() → Receives 90 USDC\n   • Validators: claimValidatorRewards() → Receive their share\n\n💰 TOTAL ECONOMICS:\n• Originator pays: 10,000 USDC\n• Contributors earn: 9,000 USDC (90% × 100 units)\n• Validators earn: 1,000 USDC (10% × 100 units)\n• Slashed tokens: Redistributed to honest stakers (increases vault share price)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ak"
    },
